{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nProcess list rendered as a tree by parent pid.\n\n## Spec\n- Columns: PID, CPU%, MEM (RSS, human size), command (name + args, truncated to the pane)\n- Tree by `ppid` via the shared `nest_by` builder; roots ordered by the active sort\n- Sort toggle key cycling CPU / MEM / PID (indicator in the pane title); the selection follows the process across refreshes (by pid)\n- `/` search over command line\n- Selection drives the detail pane\n\nPart of #93.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:26Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":95,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Procs: processes pane"}
